      "content": "it says they rely on \"unsupported interpretations\" but isn't that basically what the majority does too with their specific reading of history? like, help me understand why the dissent's view is actually \"flawed\" legally rather than just being a different interpretation of the 14th amendment. are there specific legal doctrines the dissenters ignored?",
